---
import ChipMap from '../components/ChipMap.tsx';
import f from '../facts.json';
---
<header>
  <div class="section">why custom chips</div>
  <h2>gpus do everything. ai asics do one job, fast</h2>
  <p class="sub">asic = application-specific integrated circuit: a chip designed for one kind of work</p>
</header>
<div class="asic">
  <div class="left">
    <div class="knives">
      <div class="k"><b>a gpu</b><span>a swiss army knife: started out drawing graphics, now does a bit of everything</span></div>
      <div class="k asic-k"><b>an ai asic</b><span>a chef’s knife: built to multiply huge grids of numbers, the math ai is made of</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="specs">
      <div><b>{f.card.cores}</b><span>ai cores</span></div>
      <div><b>{f.card.memory_gb} gb</b><span>memory</span></div>
      <div><b>${f.card.price_usd}</b><span>list price</span></div>
      <div><b>5090-class</b><span>matrix-math speed</span></div>
      <div class="wide"><b>open source</b><span>from the driver up. only the chip’s circuit design is closed</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="honest">the catch on the hardware side: memory speed is its main bottleneck</p>
  </div>
  <div class="right" data-steps="1"><ChipMap client:load /></div>
</div>
<style>
  .asic { display: flex; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  .left { width: 760px; flex: none; }
  .right { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .knives { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .k { background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .k b { display: block; font-size: 28px; }
  .k span { color: var(--muted); }
  .asic-k { border-color: var(--hot); }
  .specs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
  .specs div { background: var(--tint-blue); border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px 14px; }
  .specs .wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--tint-green); }
  .specs b { display: block; font-size: 30px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .specs span { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--muted); }
  .specs .wide b { display: inline; font-size: 26px; margin-right: .5em; }
  .honest { font-size: 20px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 14px; }
</style>
